v0.1.1

- date: 09.07.2026
- [Release](https://github.com/Tiro1999/MyNote/releases#release-untagged-fbf845e7daa348e86ef8)
- add finance planning tools by backslash command template
- add finance statistics on backslash command
- add table interactive user adjustments
- add table finance ledger template with ledger id for reference in statistics
- add financial import/export data functionality
- add [Money Manager App](https://www.realbyteapps.com/)
- fixed render issues/freezes on larger data imports from Money Manager Data

